    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund more transport police",
        "additional_details": "I have made this petition to help women feel safe about using public transport.",
        "background": "I want the UK government to increase funding for transport police to add more on-board police on train / bus services. I think this would help to stop any violence toward women and girls. They deserve a journey home or somewhere without a male coming up to them and abusing them.",
